    {
      "id": "claim_2d076f9315284c29a866bedff944d29d",
      "statement": "The weekly (7-day) window is only surfaced once its rounded percentage is at or above th.weekly_show_at (default 75); below that threshold the weekly gauge renders nothing and the segment shows only the 5-hour window. When shown after the 5-hour window it is joined via window_gap().",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/model/config.rs#L132-L132",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:06e699bbb0c2851cd032015b2610f35819ab1609656733e9a1ef2340289f6dba:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/segment/rate_limits.rs#L75-L90",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9c04f714e5e1ed3f23e40f37f6301ccebf3e83db81afc7edf79e83670ef1b562:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_302ae41621d443cabcbf5381e6cfc602",
      "statement": "crate::sanitize::fmt_reset(resets_at, now) formats the time-until-reset adaptively as 'Nd Nh' / 'Nh Nm' / 'Nm Ns' / 'Ns', returning None when the target is missing (<= 0) or already in the past; in the latter case no countdown is emitted but a window with a past reset still renders its percentage.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/sanitize.rs#L110-L134",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4a79e568eeb615b32d600d2fdaf4acf1be145ab22b15a87312853362cab60ad7:"
        },
        {
